########## Visual Glossaries per aggregate — open questions ##########

:Q_VG_MealOneWordTwoConcepts a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "'meal' in Meal Plan, Recipe and Help is a time of day (breakfast, lunch, dinner, supper); 'Meal' in the domain glossary and stories is the dish a Cook prepares (Cook prepares Meal, Meal with Recipe), and Meal Plan › course › meal refers to a recipe. Two concepts under one word?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_MealPlan , :Art_VG_Recipe , :Art_VG_Help ; dkg:locator "meal + values" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Meal , :Con_MealPlan_Meal , :Con_MealPlan_Course_Meal , :Con_Recipe_Meal ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_TypeAndStatusEverywhere a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "'type' (Help Request, Media › links, Thanks › recipient) and 'status' (Help Request, Cook, Notification) carry different value sets in each aggregate — minted separately here. Is any of them shared?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_HelpRequest , :Art_VG_Cook , :Art_VG_Notification , :Art_VG_Media , :Art_VG_Thanks ; dkg:locator "type / status" ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_WhoOwnsUnit a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Unit (13 values Piece … Pinch), Name and Value are drawn identically in Recipe › ingredient and Help › substitute ingredient — which aggregate owns the measure, and does Help copy it?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Recipe , :Art_VG_Help ; dkg:locator "Unit" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Recipe_Ingredient_Unit , :Con_Help_Answer_Substitutes_Substitute_SubstituteIngredient_Unit ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_MenuProposalIsAMealPlan a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Help › menu proposal has note, servings, meal, how to serve and course 1..10 (step, meal → recipe) — the Meal Plan aggregate's shape. Is a menu proposal a draft Meal Plan (the domain glossary's 'Help Meal plan')?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Help , :Art_VG_MealPlan ; dkg:locator "menu proposal" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Help_Answer_MenuProposal , :Con_MealPlan , :Con_HelpMealPlan ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_IdsAreCookIds a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "The example f64e07f0-… is the cook Id, and is reused for Consent › subject, Help Request › requester, Help › help requester, Recipe › owner, Notification › Receiver — but also for Meal Plan › meal plan Id. Meal Plan › owner and Thanks › giver use other ids. Are subject / requester / owner / Receiver / giver all Cook references?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Cook , :Art_VG_Consent , :Art_VG_HelpRequest , :Art_VG_MealPlan , :Art_VG_Thanks ; dkg:locator "examples" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Cook_CookId , :Con_Consent_Subject , :Con_HelpRequest_Requester , :Con_Recipe_Owner , :Con_MealPlan_Owner , :Con_Notification_Receiver , :Con_Thanks_Giver ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_ExampleIdClashes a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Example ids collide across aggregates: Meal preparation › preparation Id = the recipe Id (7cf09822-…); Meal preparation › recipe = the thanks Id (e1e82a2e-…); Thanks › giver = thanks Id; Media › media Id = consent Id (f0c03819-…); Meal Plan › meal plan Id = cook Id. Copy-paste examples, or intended?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_MealPreparation , :Art_VG_Thanks , :Art_VG_Media , :Art_VG_MealPlan ; dkg:locator "examples" ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_ConsentDates a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Consent › givenAt and revokedAt carry the same malformed example '2026-09-2026-09-21T12:34+02:00' — revoked at the moment it was given?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Consent ; dkg:locator "givenAt, revokedAt" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Consent_GivenAt , :Con_Consent_RevokedAt ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_CookNameGivenName a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cook › name 'Joe' and givenName 'Doe' — given name and family name swapped in the examples, or is 'name' the first name?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Cook ; dkg:locator "name, givenName" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Cook_Name , :Con_Cook_GivenName ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_ThanksRecipientsVsGlossary a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Thanks › recipient types are Grandma Avatar, Cook, Chef (0..*); the domain glossary thanks Community (0..1) and Grandma Avatar (0..1), and 'for 1 Help'. The aggregate has no Community and no Help reference — dropped, or elsewhere?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Thanks , :Art_GlossaryEnhanced ; dkg:locator "recipient" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Thanks_Recipient , :Con_Community , :Con_Help ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_HelpRequestNoMealNoPicture a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "The domain glossary says Help Request 'belongs 1 Meal' and 'contains 0..10 Picture'; the Help Request aggregate has neither (it holds 0..1 recipe, 0..1 howTo Step, 0..* ingredients) — and Media › links › type lists 'help Request'. Where do a help request's pictures live?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_HelpRequest , :Art_GlossaryEnhanced ; dkg:locator "whole aggregate" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_HelpRequest , :Con_Meal , :Con_Picture , :Con_Media_Links_Type_HelpRequest ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_VG_NotificationStatusVsPayload a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Notification › status is NEW / READ; the sync canvas PUTs a 'Status'. Does a Notification have a Help reference beyond its 'link' URL (example points at /cook-assistance/help-requests/…, not /cooking-assistance)?" ;
    dkg:source :Art_VG_Notification ; dkg:locator "link, status" ;
    dkg:mentions :Con_Notification_Link , :Con_Notification_Status ;
    dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .

