##############################################################################
# INGEST — API specifications (9 OpenAPI 3.1.0, 3 AsyncAPI 3.1.0)  (2026-10-03)
# Mode: REVISE — every spec is a revision of its API Product Canvas: 100% of
# operations match by METHOD + path (OpenAPI) or by message name + action
# (AsyncAPI), both directions. Canvas nodes are reused and enriched; canvas
# schemas the spec does not carry get dkg:absentFrom. Schema → concept links
# only on exact folded match inside the API's own aggregate (or one domain
# concept); everything else is a ledger row, not an edge.
